WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.755
And here we are.

00:02.455 --> 00:10.861
That is the story as the evidence tells it today: from meteorites, from the Moon's rocks, and from the paths of the planets themselves.

00:11.311 --> 00:13.900
Parts of it will change as we learn more.

00:14.350 --> 00:16.431
The places were all real.
